      <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>Precious Fix My Life shall not be held liable for any damages arising from the use or inability to use our products. Your use of our products signifies your agreement to these terms.</p>

      <h2>Changes to Terms</h2>
      <p>We reserve the right to modify these terms at any time. Continued use of our site and products after changes constitutes acceptance of the new terms.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about these Terms? Contact us at hello@preciousfixmylife.com.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal-page { padding: 60px 0; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .legal-page h1 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .updated { color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 0.875rem; margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .legal-page h2 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 32px 0 12px; font-weight: 700; }
  .legal-page p { margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-text-muted); }
</style>